OL,3,GNEWSAAberdeen business tycoon Sir Jim
OL,4,AMilne dies aged 85
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leading businessman and
OL,7,Fphilanthropist Sir Jim Milne has died
OL,8,Fat the age of 85.
OL,10,FA self-described "farmer's loon" from
OL,11,FAberdeen, he left school aged 14 with
OL,12,Fno qualifications, but built a career
OL,13,Fin agricultural engineering.
OL,15,FHe then helped found the Balmoral Group
OL,16,Fmanufacturing company in 1980.
OL,18,FIt developed into a global player in
OL,19,Foil and gas services, operating in over
OL,20,F15 countries, and diversified into
OL,21,Frenewable energy as well as property.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
